Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1928-09-08_95/page/n32/mode/1up


TRAM#SOS#SHAD
AERO#PEP#PACE
NAIL#ARA#ANNA
GRATER#DANGER
####METER####
PATES#I#MONEY
